    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks but it doesnt feel like a testament to anything. it just feels like a mistake. i look at the world and all i see is how much energy it takes to be \"good\" just to get punished for it. it feels like the more you care, the more you lose. i'm just so tired of fighting a system that's rigged against people like me. i dont see the point in trying to rebuild when the foundation is just rotten.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
